  "description": "Red Deer Mini Con, promoted as \"A Night at the Crimson Stag\", was an 18+ furry convention in Red Deer, Alberta, Canada, led by Jake Tiggy (Mark Jacobsen), who had run events for the Northern Alberta Mascot Performers since 2013. It started in 2015 as a one-day Halloween event and grew to a weekend at the end of October, reaching 145 attendees in 2018. Activities included fursuit bowling, trampoline park visits, pool parties, a fursuit fashion show and a haunted house.",
